{"availability":"available","full":"HectorIFC/nlp-kotlin-playground","name":"nlp-kotlin-playground","description":"nlp-kotlin-playground - An interactive playground demonstrating the Tessera + Mosaic NLP pipeline in pure Kotlin. The third piece of a 3-repo ecosystem: where the tokenizer and the embedding table finally meet a user.","category":"Design","language":"Kotlin","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-22T22:47:03Z","updated":"2026-08-03T11:55:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hectorifc.github.io/nlp-kotlin-playground/","topics":["bpe","demo","docker","educational","embeddings","ghcr","jvm","kotlin","ktor","machine-learning","mosaic","nlp","nlp-pipeline","playground","portfolio","semantic-search","tesseract","tokenizer"],"demo":"https://hectorifc.github.io/nlp-kotlin-playground/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T18:00:34.716Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T18:00:34.716Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T18:00:34.716Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T11:09:32.537Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:02:19.398Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T18:00:34.716Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An interactive playground demonstrating the Tessera + Mosaic NLP pipeline in pure Kotlin —","now with a real distributed-systems backbone behind it.","⚠️ v0.1.0 is a breaking change. The synchronous in-memory model from v0.0.x has been replaced by a queue-based distributed architecture. Path params changed from {sessionId} to {trainingId}, /upload returns 202 Accepted instead of blocking. See CHANGELOG.md for the full migration notes."],"features":["Search — top-K cosine-similar sentences for any query.","Tokenize — show how Tessera breaks a string into byte-level tokens.","Compare — cosine similarity between any two strings.","MinIO over filesystem — corpora and model artifacts live in object storage with TTL rules (1 day on uploads, 1 day on models) inste